  "body": "Character windows, native timber flooring and classic weatherboards. It's getting harder to find homes with this much genuine personality on the Coast, and 17 Ladies Mile has charm in spades. Add a brilliant beachside location, a generous backyard and some exciting extra possibilities, and you've got something pretty special.\r\n\r\nAnd those extra possibilities are worth talking about! A substantial 18m² consented sleepout, complete with its own bathroom, provides fantastic flexibility for visiting family, teenagers, a creative studio or potentially an Airbnb income stream, subject to any necessary approvals. It's a valuable addition that could even help generate some extra income.\r\n\r\nNow, imagine family life looking a little like this...\r\nRunning late for school? No stress, it's an easy 250m downhill stroll to the school gates. And when the school day is done, keep wandering down Ladies Mile, where beautiful Manly Beach awaits at the end of the street. Safe swimming, golden sand and those long summer evenings that make living on the Coast so special.\r\n\r\nBack at home, there's a lovely warmth and personality throughout. Open-plan living flows effortlessly to a covered entertaining deck, perfect for summer barbecues, family dinners or simply enjoying the beautiful views across Manly towards the beach. Thanks to its elevated position and established planting on the southern side, the home also stays wonderfully cool through summer, with natural shade from the high summer sun.\r\n\r\nPracticality hasn't been forgotten either, with an internal-access garage and additional off-street parking making everyday life that much easier.\r\n\r\nStep down into the generous backyard and discover a productive garden filled with fruit trees including peach, apple, pear, lemon, lime, mandarin, olive, fig and feijoa. There's also a mature asparagus patch, blueberries, a curry tree and herbs. Garden-to-table living right in your own backyard!\r\n\r\nAnd then there's Manly itself. A neighbourhood with a genuine sense of community, where locals know their neighbours and the legendary Halloween celebrations bring the streets to life. With the Manly Sailing Club, tennis courts, bowling club, great restaurants, cafés and shops all nearby, everything you need is close to home.\r\n\r\nCharacter you can't replicate, a location that's hard to beat and possibilities that extend well beyond the main home.\r\n\r\n17 Ladies Mile is all about making family life a little easier, weekends a lot more fun and creating memories in one of the Coast's most loved beachside neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nTo download the property documents copy this link into your browser: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/KAJQ",
